Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: {{ DEPS }}
Description: GPU userspace stack built from source ({{ PROFILE }}, {{ LEVEL }})
 Mesa (OpenGL, EGL, GBM, Vulkan, video acceleration, OpenCL where the profile
 enables it) built in CI from the upstream release matching Debian's Mesa
 version, with every Gallium and Vulkan driver the architecture supports.
 Installed under /usr/lib/dc-gpu/{{ PROFILE }} and /usr/share/dc-gpu/{{ PROFILE }}
 only: it coexists with the other profile and stays inert until `dc-gpu`
 activates it. The x64v2/x64v3 packages carry only the libraries rebuilt for
 that CPU level, in glibc-hwcaps directories that the dynamic linker prefers
 on a CPU supporting the level.
